b424846e24ee813643f7ec532a .av-subheading{\nfont-size:15px;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='av-special-heading av-m0okyjw0-e83e95b424846e24ee813643f7ec532a av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote modern-centered  avia-builder-el-3  el_before_av_textblock  avia-builder-el-first '><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop=\"headline\"  >Jean Louis David: Innovaci\u00f3n y Estilo que Trasciende<\/h2><div class=\"special-heading-border\"><div class=\"special-heading-inner-border\"><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<section  class='av_textblock_section av-m0ol26fh-5adbcd5bcc1fd36f00321cc780c205ac '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p style=\"text-align: center;\">Desde 1961, Jean Louis David ha transformado el estilismo en un arte, siempre un paso adelante en la evoluci\u00f3n de los gustos y deseos de nuestros clientes. Nuestra misi\u00f3n es hacer que cada visita a nuestros salones sea una experiencia de belleza \u00fanica y personalizada.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-m0ol4q0r-a69e93a2e675e799cbbc901d63893ba6\">\n\n@media only screen and (min-width: 990px){ \n#top .togglecontainer.av-m0ol4q0r-a69e93a2e675e799cbbc901d63893ba6 p.toggler{\nfont-size:18px;\n}\n#top .togglecontainer.av-m0ol4q0r-a69e93a2e675e799cbbc901d63893ba6 .toggle_wrap .toggle_content{\nfont-size:18px;\n}\n}\n\n@media only screen and (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 989px){ \n#top .togglecontainer.av-m0ol4q0r-a69e93a2e675e799cbbc901d63893ba6 p.toggler{\nfont-size:18px;\n}\n#top .togglecontainer.av-m0ol4q0r-a69e93a2e675e799cbbc901d63893ba6 .toggle_wrap .toggle_content{\nfont-size:18px;\n}\n}\n\n@media only screen and (min-width: 480px) and (max-width: 767px){ \n#top .togglecontainer.av-m0ol4q0r-a69e93a2e675e799cbbc901d63893ba6 p.toggler{\nfont-size:17px;\n}\n#top .togglecontainer.av-m0ol4q0r-a69e93a2e675e799cbbc901d63893ba6 .toggle_wrap .toggle_content{\nfont-size:17px;\n}\n}\n\n@media only screen and (max-width: 479px){ \n#top .togglecontainer.av-m0ol4q0r-a69e93a2e675e799cbbc901d63893ba6 p.toggler{\nfont-size:17px;\n}\n#top .togglecontainer.av-m0ol4q0r-a69e93a2e675e799cbbc901d63893ba6 .toggle_wrap .toggle_content{\nfont-size:17px;\n}\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='togglecontainer av-m0ol4q0r-a69e93a2e675e799cbbc901d63893ba6 av-elegant-toggle  avia-builder-el-5  el_after_av_textblock  avia-builder-el-last  toggle_close_all' >\n<section class='av_toggle_section av-m0ol4aeb-f7753df24fe386e3ad83983f2c95b01b'  itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div role=\"tablist\" class=\"single_toggle\" data-tags=\"{All} \"  ><p id='toggle-toggle-id-1' data-fake-id='#toggle-id-1' class='toggler  av-title-above '  itemprop=\"headline\"  role='tab' tabindex='0' aria-controls='toggle-id-1' data-slide-speed=\"200\" data-title=\"Conoce m\u00e1s\" data-title-open=\"\">Conoce m\u00e1s<span class=\"toggle_icon\"><span class=\"vert_icon\"><\/span><span class=\"hor_icon\"><\/span><\/span><\/p><div id='toggle-id-1' aria-labelledby='toggle-toggle-id-1' role='region' class='toggle_wrap  av-title-above'  ><div class='toggle_content invers-color '  itemprop=\"text\" ><p style=\"text-align: center;\">Desde su fundaci\u00f3n en 1961 en la ic\u00f3nica Avenida de Wagram en Par\u00eds, Jean Louis David ha sido sin\u00f3nimo de innovaci\u00f3n, elegancia y vanguardia en el mundo de la belleza. Con una visi\u00f3n \u00fanica y una pasi\u00f3n por destacar la belleza femenina, Jean Louis David transform\u00f3 el peinado en un arte que evoluciona constantemente, adapt\u00e1ndose a los gustos y deseos de cada \u00e9poca.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Con su esp\u00edritu visionario, Jean Louis David revolucion\u00f3 la peluquer\u00eda en los a\u00f1os 70, creando t\u00e9cnicas y estilos que liberaron a las mujeres de los cortes r\u00edgidos. Su famoso corte escalado, introducido por primera vez en 1970, rompi\u00f3 con las normas establecidas y sigue siendo un \u00edcono hasta hoy. Pero su legado va m\u00e1s all\u00e1 de la t\u00e9cnica: Jean Louis David entendi\u00f3 que la belleza es una expresi\u00f3n personal, y dedic\u00f3 su vida a ofrecer a las mujeres estilos modernos, vers\u00e1tiles y f\u00e1ciles de llevar.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/section>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><!-- close content main div --><\/div><\/div><div id='av-layout-grid-1'  class='av-layout-grid-container av-z0gn-3abaf7ba0d825ef56322ffd417b98c8b entry-content-wrapper main_color av-flex-cells  avia-builder-el-6  el_after_av_section  el_before_av_layout_row  grid-row-not-first  container_wrap sidebar_right'  >\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-m0pl7235-ae3c699d6e73466d15b8fad1b8dd3b39\">\n.flex_cell.av-m0pl7235-ae3c699d6e73466d15b8fad1b8dd3b39{\nvertical-align:top;\nheight:550px;\nmin-height:550px;\nbackground:url(https:\/\/jeanlouisdavid.com.mx\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/Jean-Louis-David-upscale-1030x1028.jpeg) 100% 0% no-repeat scroll ;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div class='flex_cell av-m0pl7235-ae3c699d6e73466d15b8fad1b8dd3b39 av-gridrow-cell av_one_half no_margin  avia-builder-el-7  el_before_av_cell_one_half  avia-builder-el-first  avia-full-stretch'  ><div class='flex_cell_inner'><\/div><\/div>\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-m0pl7nop-aaa674a3ad28a6fb74a12e9648b1e18e\">\n.flex_cell.av-m0pl7nop-aaa674a3ad28a6fb74a12e9648b1e18e{\nvertical-align:middle;\nheight:550px;\nmin-height:550px;\nbackground-color:#282828;\n}\n\n@media only screen and (min-width: 990px){ \n.responsive #top #wrap_all .flex_cell.av-m0pl7nop-aaa674a3ad28a6fb74a12e9648b1e18e{\npadding:100px 100px 100px 100px !important;\n}\n}\n\n@media only screen and (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 989px){ \n.responsive #top #wrap_all .flex_cell.av-m0pl7nop-aaa674a3ad28a6fb74a12e9648b1e18e{\npadding:100px 100px 100px 100px 