-css-av-m0olqf5w-ac1556ceaa13107fc8e840c7f744089f\">\n#top .av_textblock_section.av-m0olqf5w-ac1556ceaa13107fc8e840c7f744089f .avia_textblock{\ncolor:#ffffff;\n}\n<\/style>\n<section  class='av_textblock_section av-m0olqf5w-ac1556ceaa13107fc8e840c7f744089f '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock av_inherit_color'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p>Con m\u00e1s de 1,000 salones en todo el mundo, Jean Louis David es una marca de referencia en salones de belleza. En M\u00e9xico, contamos con dos sucursales en en Polanco y Santa Fe. Cada sal\u00f3n mantiene la esencia de nuestra marca, adaptando las tendencias globales al estilo y necesidades de nuestras clientas locales.<\/p>\n<p>Nuestro compromiso es ofrecer cortes y colores que no solo luzcan espectaculares, sino que tambi\u00e9n sean f\u00e1ciles de mantener en casa. Nos dedicamos a crear estilos que perduren y resalten lo mejor de cada visitante, con el toque audaz y moderno que caracteriza a nuestros salones.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[],"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-59","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/jeanlouisdavid.com.mx\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/59","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/jeanlouisdavid.com.mx\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/jeanlouisdavid.com.mx\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/jeanlouisdavid.com.mx\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/jeanlouisdavid.com.mx\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=59"}],"version-history":[{"count":33,"href":"https:\/\/jeanlouisdavid.com.mx\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/59\/revisions"}],"predecessor-versi